# Transient LaTeX/pdfcrop build byproducts from analysis/report
# renders (tools/render.sh); the rendered .tex/.pdf/.log are tracked,
# these intermediate files are not.
analysis/report/tmp-pdfcrop-*.tex
analysis/report/report.toc
analysis/report/report.aux
analysis/report/report.knit.md

# knitr chunk cache: a regenerable local build accelerator, not
# reproducible source. Its __packages file records whatever packages
# happened to be attached in the interactive session that built it
# (not just packages the cached chunk actually uses) and knitr's
# cache-restore path unconditionally library()s every name in that
# file, so a stray package there (e.g. palmerpenguins, loaded from an
# unrelated exploration session) breaks any environment that doesn't
# have it -- this is exactly what broke Render Reports CI.
analysis/report/cache/
